# Agent harness (RAVEN and per-tool adapters).
#
# Deliberately NOT vendored into this repository. These trees are installed and
# upgraded per-developer by `raven install` / `raven upgrade`, so committing them
# would put every upgrade in this project's public history, and would ship
# executable agent hooks to contributors who never asked for them. Contributors
# are free to install their own harness; none is required to build or test.
#
# See AGENTS.md, which stays committed and documents the conventions themselves.
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.raven/

# MCP server manifest. Same reasoning, with one addition: a committed .mcp.json
# is config that causes command execution on clone — an agent session opening
# this repo would offer to launch semgrep/semble/gitnexus/language-server
# binaries a contributor may not have and did not ask for. AGENTS.md already
# treats these as locally configured capabilities rather than dependencies.
.mcp.json

# Machine-local agent settings. Listed separately on purpose: it must stay
# ignored even if `.claude/` above is ever un-ignored to share project config.
.claude/settings.local.json
